  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4474,
      "text": "Hā Mīm[1].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 499,
      "ruku": 434,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4475,
      "text": "The revelation of this Book is from Allah, the All-Mighty, the All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 499,
      "ruku": 434,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4476,
      "text": "Indeed, there are signs in the heavens and earth for the believers;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 499,
      "ruku": 434,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4477,
      "text": "and in your creation and the living creatures that He spreads out, there are signs for people who are certain in faith.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 499,
      "ruku": 434,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4478,
      "text": "And in the alternation of the night and day, the provision that Allah sends down from the sky[2], reviving thereby the earth after its death, and directing of the winds, there are signs for people of understanding.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 499,
      "ruku": 434,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4479,
      "text": "These are the verses of Allah that We recite to you in truth. What message will they believe in after Allah and His verses?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 499,
      "ruku": 434,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4480,
      "text": "Woe to every sinful liar,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 499,
      "ruku": 434,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4481,
      "text": "who hears the verses of Allah being recited to him, yet he persists in his arrogance, as if he did not hear them. So give him tidings of a painful punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 499,
      "ruku": 434,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4482,
      "text": "When he comes to know anything of Our verses, he takes them in ridicule. For them there will be a humiliating punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 499,
      "ruku": 434,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4483,
      "text": "Behind them is Hell; neither their gains nor those whom they took besides Allah as protectors will avail them anything, and for them there will be a great punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 499,
      "ruku": 434,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4484,
      "text": "This [Qur’an] is guidance, and for those who disbelieve in the verses of their Lord, there will be a scourge of painful torment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 499,
      "ruku": 434,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4485,
      "text": "It is Allah Who has subjected for you the sea, so that the ships may sail on it by His command, and so that you may seek His bounty, and so that you may be grateful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 499,
      "ruku": 435,
      "hizbQuarter": 200,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4486,
      "text": "And He has subjected for you all that is in the heavens and all that is on earth; all is from Him. Indeed, there are signs in this for people who reflect.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
